  "definition": "The [pressure](/term/pressure) created when a [player](/term/player) has [lethal](/term/lethal) on a [target](/term/target). A player with kill pressure is afforded more freedom in decision-making, since their target risks their life if they attempt to [contest](/term/contest). Kill pressure is most frequently discussed in the context of the isolated lane phase.",
